MeetAssistant 🎓

Your AI helper for Google Meet!

MeetAssistant is a Chrome extension that helps students during online school meetings. It reads meeting subtitles and uses AI to understand the conversation and suggest relevant answers. It works in Russian and Ukrainian.

Less stress, more confidence. You don't need to study anymore) 😉

HOW TO INSTALL

1. Download the extension and extract the ZIP archive into a folder.
2. Open Chrome and go to chrome://extensions.
3. Turn on Developer mode in the top-right corner.
4. Click Load unpacked in the top-left corner.
5. Select the folder where you extracted the extension.
6. Make sure the extension is enabled.

HOW TO GET YOUR GROQ API KEY

1. Go to https://console.groq.com/
2. Sign in or create an account.
3. Open the API Keys section.
4. Create an API key and copy it.
5. Open MeetAssistant settings, paste your key, and save.

HOW TO USE IT

1. Join a Google Meet meeting in Chrome.
2. Turn on captions using the captions button in Google Meet.
3. Make sure captions are in Russian or Ukrainian.
4. Open MeetAssistant and let it read the subtitles.
5. When someone asks a question, the AI will use the conversation context to suggest an answer.

That's all! No complicated setup, no local AI models, and no powerful computer required.

TROUBLESHOOTING

If it doesn't work, check that captions are enabled, your Groq API key is correct, and your selected AI model is available to your account.

If the AI doesn't understand the conversation, wait until more subtitles appear so it has enough context.

If you modify the extension files, open chrome://extensions and click the reload icon on the extension card.

PRIVACY

MeetAssistant reads visible Google Meet subtitles. Relevant conversation text may be sent to Groq to generate answers. Don't use it for confidential conversations without permission, and follow your school's rules.

Keep your API key private. Never share it publicly.

IMPORTANT

AI-generated answers can be wrong. Always use your own judgment and verify important information.

Made for students. Learn smarter, not harder!
